 The constant term is 47.68, and it is significant at the 0.1% level.
 Thus, on average, the kindergarten students in the small class had an average
 percentile score of 56.193, students in the regular class had an average
 percentile score of 47.68, and those in the regular class with an aide has
 an average percentile score of 51.145.
